{"availability":"available","full":"shahriar-ahmed-seam/coregrid","name":"coregrid","description":"CoreGrid — The Autonomous Enterprise System. A full-stack AI-native ERP (HR, CRM, Inventory, Finance, Projects) with private on-device AI. Runs standalone for instant demos.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-30T19:04:18Z","updated":"2026-06-30T19:46:56Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://coregrid.vercel.app","topics":["ai","crm","dashboard","erp","finance","fullstack","hr","inventory-management","nextjs","ollama","prisma","react","saas","tailwindcss","typescript"],"demo":"https://coregrid.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.502Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.502Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.502Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.502Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One intelligent grid for HR, CRM, Inventory, Finance & Projects — with private, on-device AI.","Live Demo · Features · Architecture · Quick Start · Deploy","CoreGrid is a full-stack, production-grade Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) platform that unifies a company's core operations into a single, calm workspace. It pairs a deeply relational data model (30+ entities) with role-based access control, live cross-module analytics, and privacy-first AI that runs locally through Ollama — so sensitive business data never leaves your infrastructure."],"features":["🛰️ Standalone Demo Mode — runs anywhere (including Vercel) with zero backend. A realistic sample company is served from an in-memory, Prisma-compatible engine so you can explore the entire product instantly.","🏢 Full Mode — backed by PostgreSQL, NextAuth and Ollama for real deployments.","🤖 Private AI — local LLM analysis for HR, finance, inventory, sales & projects; AI email drafting and resume parsing. Nothing is sent to a third party.","🔐 RBAC — seven roles (Admin, HR, Sales, Inventory, Finance, Project Manager, Employee) enforced in middleware and on the server.","🧾 Audit logging — every critical action recorded."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shahriar-ahmed-seam/coregrid/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ce8ed1f0db23c3ffc8d169093724737e9aea7be855ed26a748842217b99d6171","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.623Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.623Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"One intelligent grid for HR, CRM, Inventory, Finance & Projects — with private, on-device AI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shahriar-ahmed-seam/coregrid/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ce8ed1f0db23c3ffc8d169093724737e9aea7be855ed26a748842217b99d6171","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shahriar-ahmed-seam/coregrid/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.623Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-30T19:46:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shahriar-ahmed-seam/coregrid/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:36.624Z","hash":"ce8ed1f0db23c3ffc8d169093724737e9aea7be855ed26a748842217b99d6171","originalBytes":7363,"storedBytes":7363,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["run","npm","demo","full","ollama","database","docker","prisma","postgresql","projects","sample","url","app","data","engine","finance","inventory","standalone","bash","company","coregrid","features","license","mocks","next","next.js","nextauth","public","real","seed","true","admin","architecture","auth","crm","css","customers","default","deployment","dev","employees","enterprise","live","mode","model","photography","production","push","react","runs","schema","secret","stack","start","tailwind","vercel","ai.","analytics","api","backend","build","cinematic","client","components","compose","core","cross-module","dashboard","departments","deployment.md","end","entire","environment","every","handlers","in-memory","install